<h3>🚀 Features</h3>
<ul>
    <li>🪵 A PSR-3 compliant, daily-file <code>Logger</code> with message interpolation.</li>
    <li>🧩 A <code>CompositeLogger</code> broadcasting to many PSR-3 loggers (WeakMap-based).</li>
    <li>🔄 A Monolog-based rotating-file manager (<code>MonoLogManager</code>) and a <code>LoggerManager</code> base class.</li>
    <li>🧰 Composable logger traits — <code>LoggerTrait</code>, <code>LoggerManagerTrait</code>, <code>DebugTrait</code>.</li>
    <li>✨ Custom Monolog processors — emoji and symbol level decorators.</li>
    <li>🧪 100% unit-test line coverage, ensuring reliability and maintainability.</li>
</ul>

<h3>📦 Installation</h3>
<p>This library requires <a href="https://php.net/releases/" target="_blank">PHP 8.4+</a> and is installed via <a href="https://getcomposer.org/" target="_blank">Composer</a>:</p>
<pre class="language-bash prettyprint">composer require oihana/php-logging</pre>

<h3>✅ Tests &amp; coverage</h3>
<p>Run the unit-test suite (PHPUnit, strict mode):</p>
<pre class="language-bash prettyprint">composer test</pre>

<p>Measure coverage (requires Xdebug or PCOV):</p>
<pre class="language-bash prettyprint">composer coverage
composer coverage:md</pre>

